  { behavior: 'Verification email reaches the reader', state: 'reader email', zh: '主题“评论已发布 · 验证一下邮箱” · 评论已发布。 · 验证邮箱', en: 'Subject “Your comment is live — confirm your email” · Your comment is live. · Confirm email', next: 'Open the confirmation page or ignore the expiring link' },
